            ],
            "description": "Initially configured as a fire detection and alarm system, the flexibility of Taktis is such that it can be re-configured to realise many other control and indication applications, with direct integration into intelligent buildings. Available in four and eight slot variants, INFINITY ire control panel ranges from two to 16 detection loops. INFINITY can network up to 128 panels, making it ideal for the largest sites such as schools, hospitals, multi-site retail/ supermarkets, critical infrastructure and major commercial and industrial facilities. As a truly open protocol panel it offers installers and their customers maximum flexibility in systems\u2019 design, site-customization and in the third-party devices that they use. Not only does INFINITY provide solutions to the most technically challenging applications in life safety, it will also deliver added value, market advantage and a competitive edge to your business.",
            "features": [
              "UL864 (10th edition) Listed and FM Approved",
              "2 to 8 loop or 2 to 16 loop versions",
              "400mA loop current",
              "4 programmable NACs; Class B or 2 Class A with internal synchronization",
              "5.25 A or 10.25 A power supply options",
              "3 programmable inputs and 5 programmable relay outputs",
              "7 inch, full-color resistive touch screen with intuitive user interface",
              "Up to 24 programmable soft \u201cfunction keys\u201d",
              "Hard-wired ire and trouble routing inputs and outputs",
              "Modular and expandable electronics",
              "400 subaddress points per loop (800 per loop module)",
              "Option to \u201cinvert\u201d inputs and outputs",
              "5000 programmable cause and efects; over 50,000 inputs and outputs",
              "Can be networked with programmable functionality",
              "Programming via USB port to PC or memory stick",
              "Ockular graphical fire management system"
            ],
            "documents": [
              {
                "title": "Data Sheets",
                "url": "https://fire-watch.co/storage/images/ProductFile/ProductFile_6705010e0821d.pdf"
              },
              {
                "title": "UL Certificate",
                "url": "https://fire-watch.co/storage/images/ProductFile/ProductFile_66fb2139f2a26.pdf"
              },
              {
                "title": "UL Confirmation Letters (All Infinity Models)",
                "url": "https://fire-watch.co/storage/images/ProductFile/ProductFile_6708169c5767f.pdf"
              }
            ],
            "breadcrumb": [],
            "listingDescription": "INFINITY is FIREWATCH s most powerful and sophisticated analogue addressable ire panel. Intelligent and technically robust, it has enhanced integration and networking capabilities to meet the current and future needs of small to larger buildings and installations."
          },
