            "description": "The Fire Watch manual pull station is a robust, high-quality, die-cast unit designed for durability and reliability in fire safety systems. Featuring a low-profile design with smooth, clean edges, it combines aesthetics with functionality, making it suitable for a variety of installations. Each component is either powder-coated or plated to provide superior corrosion resistance, ensuring longevity in both indoor and outdoor environments. The pull station operates with a Single-Pole Single-Throw (SPST) switch rated at 10 amps @ 125 VAC, delivering consistent, reliable performance for effective fire alarm activation when needed.",
            "features": [
