            "description": "The Fire Watch UL Open-Area Sounder Visual Indicator offers a selection of 15 customizable evacuation tones, ensuring compliance with local regulations and specific site requirements. In addition to the main evacuation tone, a secondary alert tone can be set for warnings or pre-evacuation alerts. With adjustable sound levels, spanning seven distinct options, the device allows for precise volume control to suit different environments. The unit provides flexibility by enabling both the sounder and visual indicator to operate together or separately, making it adaptable for varied installation needs and ensuring optimal performance across all situations.",
            "features": [
              "15 evacuation tones + 15 secondary or alert tones",
              "Alarm switching by individual device, of all devices on the loop",
              "Independent control of sounder and beacon",
              "Set-up and testing of devices at point of installation",
              "Isolator status information",
              "Sounder automatically silences after 20 minutes (optional)",
              "Class change bell tone"
