            "description": "A single programming method using just 3 front panel buttons allows an extensive list of curation options to be set and reviewed. Single board construction enables easy removal of all electronic parts by removing just two screws, and ample provision of cable entry knockouts simplify installation. 4 Amo notification appliance power and built-in selectable sync protocols provide ample power and control for a wide range of standard notification appliances. The built-in RS485 communications bus provides the facility to connect 4 wire annunciators or ancillary relay boards to provide further indication and control options throughout a premises.",
